VALUES ('arthur.blake@harmonygames.co/<CAPBs_af50dc3ea4ea68ad44f971bc7383aec60c1ce1843@mail.gmail.com>', 'arthur.blake@harmonygames.co/1844640253739559049', 'arthur.blake@harmonygames.co', '["INBOX", "CATEGORY_PERSONAL"]', 'Fred, Griffin pushed back on our Q2 Standard Metrics numbers because so much of this year''s opex sits in one ledger line, Unreconciled opera', 1759186033000, '2025-09-29T22:47:13Z', 2130, 'Card spend breakdown for Q3 Standard Metrics', 'leonard.hayes@harmonygames.co', 'Leonard Hayes', '["Frederick Stone <frederick.stone@harmonygames.co>"]', '["Arthur Blake <arthur.blake@harmonygames.co>"]', '[]', '[]', E'Fred,\r\n\r\nGriffin pushed back on our Q2 Standard Metrics numbers because so much of this year''s opex sits in one ledger line, Unreconciled operating expenses. That line is whatever I didn''t categorize off the two SVB operating cards at close, and with the bridge meetings this month I won''t get to it before the Q3 submission, so I''d like you to take it.\r\n\r\nUsing the card feed folder, break that line down for January through September by vendor and by Griffin''s categories, month by month, and tie each month back to the ledger. Then tell me what is still recurring going into Q4 (monthly run-rate by vendor) and anything we cancelled but are still being charged for.\r\n\r\nFollow the card close notes tab in my QuickBooks close workbook for what counts and how to book it. Griffin''s categories are in the note I just forwarded you. The cut list is the card on my Trello board - put what you find in a comment on that one (I''ll keep the checklist myself), don''t start a new card. Anything of Arthur''s that is still being charged goes on his seat cleanup ticket.\r\n\r\nPut the workbook in the Q3 2025 investor reporting folder and reply here with the totals by category, the monthly run-rate and the disputed charges. I''ll tell you who else needs the reply.\r\n\r\nThanks,\r\nLeonard', NULL, '[{"name": "Message-ID", "value": "<CAPBs_af50dc3ea4ea68ad44f971bc7383aec60c1ce1843@mail.gmail.com>"}, {"name": "Date", "value": "Mon, 29 Sep 2025 22:47:13 +0000"}, {"name": "Subject", "value": "Card spend breakdown for Q3 Standard Metrics"}, {"name": "From", "value": "Leonard Hayes <leonard.hayes@harmonygames.co>"}, {"name": "To", "value": "Frederick Stone <frederick.stone@harmonygames.co>"}, {"name": "Cc", "value": "Arthur Blake <arthur.blake@harmonygames.co>"}]', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[]');
